sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as httpclient.Client
    participant Retry as retry.Middleware
    participant Attempt as One attempt of the client
    participant API as Todo API

    Client->>+Retry: the call, Retryable, next
    loop up to TODO_API_RETRY_ATTEMPTS, 3 by default
        Retry->>+Attempt: next(ctx)
        Attempt->>+API: POST /v1/items/plan, within TODO_API_TIMEOUT
        API-->>-Attempt: answer, or none
        Attempt-->>-Retry: success, or outcome.ErrUnavailable
        Note over Retry: success, a status, or the last attempt: leave the loop
        Note over Retry: outcome.ErrUnavailable: WARN "api client call retried", wait 100ms doubled, plus or minus 50 percent
        Note over Retry: no wait starts that would end past the deadline of ctx
    end
    Retry-->>-Client: the outcome of the last attempt
